      ":question/problem": "Calculate $X+Y-Z$, where\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 5 \\\\ -8 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,Y=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -1 \\\\ -2 & -8\\end{bmatrix},\\,Z=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & -8 \\\\ -5 & -6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n| $X+Y-Z=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |",
